OL,3,GNEWSAM60 closure leaves drivers
OL,4,Astranded for hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers in Manchester have reported
OL,7,Fbeing stranded for hours after planned
OL,8,Fmotorway closures over the weekend.
OL,10,FThe disruption on the M60 near Simister
OL,11,FIsland led to congestion on roads
OL,12,Facross Prestwich and Higher Blackley.
OL,14,FNational Highways closed the motorway
OL,15,Fbetween junction 17 and 18 to remove
OL,16,Ffive overhead gantries as part of a
OL,17,Fmajor upgrade project.
OL,19,FCatherine Kedward was travelling from
OL,20,FAtherton to Chadderton on Sunday with
OL,21,Fher five-year-old daughter.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
